  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNOPS Restoring Communities and Social Infrastructure Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the project is to contribute to the revival of the Communities in the City of Mykolaiv and restoring the educational infrastructure across the Mykolaiv region of Ukraine. The project focuses on four key objectives: providing shelter in Mykolaiv City by rehabilitating three micro-districts and restoring essential services such as education, healthcare, and utilities; enhancing safety by building bomb shelters and secure spaces for education and childcare across the city and region; supporting local communities and livelihoods through grants; and conducting a feasibility study for the rehabilitation of the National University of Shipbuilding in Mykolaiv.</narrative>
  </description>
